      "statement": "The fused Muon kernel applies Nesterov momentum, MuonEq row equilibration, Polar Express orthogonalisation with tall/wide variants, Muon+ Frobenius renormalisation, NorMuon factored variance reduction, and cautious weight decay applied only where update and parameter share sign; the group LR is scaled by sqrt(max(1, m/n)).",
